    "enUS": {
      "description": "Oh, hello. Ayessa sent you to assist me? Very well then. \r\n\r\nNot sure what an obvious novice like yourself can do, but if you give me a moment to pull my head out of this construct's innards I might have a few ideas of things you can do to help.",
